{"id":"oton_o","lemma":"otoño","pos":"noun","rank":2746,"glosses":["autumn, fall"],"ipa":"/oˈtoɲo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"otoños"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-oto%C3%B1o.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cuanto antes vuelva el otoño, mejor.","en":"The sooner it's autumn again, the better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/769684","words":[null,null,{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"better"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"as soon as possible"]]},{"text":"El otoño ha llegado.","en":"Autumn is here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440619","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"arrived"}]},{"text":"Prefiero la primavera al otoño.","en":"I prefer spring to fall.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37943","words":[{"g":"to prefer","l":"preferir"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"spring"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"No parece que estemos en otoño.","en":"It doesn't seem like it's autumn.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684788","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"El otoño empieza en septiembre.","en":"Fall starts in September.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152610","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"September"}]}]}